      "question": "Which of the following options best suits the Venn diagram given in the figure?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Which of the following options best suits the Venn diagram given in the figure?</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https:https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/01/F1_Shraddha_Prashant_20.01%20%2836%29.png\" style=\"width: 82px; height: 81px;\" /></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Human, Boys, Girls",
          "html": "Human, Boys, Girls"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Boys, Singers, Players",
          "html": "Boys, Singers, Players"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Boys, Vegetarian, Human",
          "html": "Boys, Vegetarian, Human"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Girls, Makeup, Fashion",
          "html": "Girls, Makeup, Fashion"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>The logic follows here is :</p>\n\n<p>1. All the Boys are Human.</p>\n\n<p>2. Some Boys are Vegetarian and vice versa.</p>\n\n<p>3. Some Humans&nbsp;are Vegetarian and vice versa.</p>\n\n<p>The least possible Venn diagram for the given set of words is :</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/04/F1_Prabhu_Nishad_05.04.21_D3.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&quot;</span><strong>Boys, Vegetarian, Human</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&quot;.</span></p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https:https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/01/F1_Shraddha_Prashant_20.01%20%2836%29.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/04/F1_Prabhu_Nishad_05.04.21_D3.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
